  "about": {
    "eyebrow": "WHO WE ARE",
    "title": "GoldPrime Paints",
    "body": "GoldPrime Paints is the flagship brand of Goldprime Global Nig. Ltd., a Nigerian-owned company specializing in the manufacturing, supply and professional application of premium decorative and protective coating solutions.\n\nDriven by a passion for excellence, we provide innovative paint products that combine superior quality, aesthetic appeal, and long lasting performance. Our solutions are carefully developed to meet the needs of homeowners, architects, contractors, property developers, government institutions and corporate organizations seeking reliable finishing solutions.\n\nWith a commitment to continuous improvement and customer satisfaction, Goldprime has successfully contributed to numerous residential, commercial and institutional projects, delivering finishes that enhance the beauty while protecting surfaces against harsh environmental conditions.\n\nBeyond manufacturing quality paints, we offer professional painting services, colour consultation, surface preparation and technical support, ensuring that every project benefits from expert guidance and exceptional workmanship.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "label": "Superior coverage",
        "image": "/Outdoor-look-1.png",
        "alt": "White and charcoal exterior"
      },
      {
        "label": "Long-lasting",
        "image": "/Outdoor-look-2.png",
        "alt": "Blue textured exterior"
      },
      {
        "label": "Rich colour",
        "image": "/Outdoor-look-4.png",
        "alt": "White and brown exterior"
      }
    ],
    "bannerTitle": "Express your world in colours.",
    "bannerBody": "We create lasting impressions. Premium quality products, superior coverage, long-lasting performance, and rich, vibrant colours.",
    "bannerCta": "Choose your shade",
    "vision": "To become one of Africa's most trusted and innovative paint manufacturing brands, recognized for delivering premium coating solutions that transform spaces, protect investments and inspire confidence through quality, durability and exceptional services.",
    "mission": "To manufacture and supply premium quality paints and coating solutions using innovative processes and quality raw materials, while delivering outstanding customer service, professional painting solutions and long-term value to every client.",
    "value": "Quality. We are committed to producing products that meet high standards of performance, consistency, and durability.",
    "letter": "At Goldprime Paints, we believe colour is more than decoration. It is a reflection of quality, identity and excellence. Every product we manufacture represents our commitment to delivering premium coating solutions that combine beauty, durability and value.\n\nAs a proudly Nigerian company, we are passionate about transforming residential, commercial and institutional spaces through innovative paint products and professional painting services. Our success is built on integrity, consistency and an unwavering dedication to customer satisfaction.\n\nWe value every opportunity to partner with homeowners, contractors, architects, developers and organizations. We remain committed to delivering solutions that exceed expectations.\n\nThank you for choosing Goldprime Paints. We look forward to adding colour and lasting value to your next project.",
    "letterName": "Damilola Adeleye",
    "letterRole": "Managing Director / Chief Executive Officer"
  },
